---
const x0 = 90, y0 = 300, XW = 100, H = 240; // 1τ = 100px, 100% = 240px
const px = (t) => x0 + XW * t;
const py = (p) => y0 - (H * p) / 100;
const pts = Array.from({ length: 51 }, (_, i) => i / 10);
const path = pts.map((t, i) => `${i ? 'L' : 'M'}${px(t).toFixed(1)} ${py(100 * (1 - Math.exp(-t))).toFixed(1)}`).join('');
const marks = [[1, 63.2], [2, 86.5], [3, 95.0], [5, 99.3]];
---
<figure class="tl__fig">
  <svg class="sv" viewBox="0 0 660 380" role="img" aria-labelledby="rc-t rc-d">
    <title id="rc-t">커패시터 충전 곡선</title>
    <desc id="rc-d">저항을 통해 커패시터를 충전하면 전압이 처음에는 빠르게, 나중에는 천천히 올라간다. 시간상수 τ가 지나면 63%, 2τ에서 86%, 3τ에서 95%, 5τ에서 99%.</desc>
    <rect class="panel" x="5" y="5" width="650" height="370" rx="12"/>
    <path d={`M${x0} ${y0}H${px(5) + 20}M${x0} ${y0}V${py(100) - 24}`} stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2.5" fill="none"/>
    <path d={`M${x0} ${py(100)}H${px(5)}`} stroke="var(--rule2)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
    {marks.map((m) => <path d={`M${x0} ${py(m[1])}H${px(m[0])}V${y0}`} stroke="var(--rule2)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" fill="none"/>)}
    <path d={path} stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="4" fill="none" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    {marks.map((m) => <circle cx={px(m[0])} cy={py(m[1])} r="5" fill="var(--accent)"/>)}

    <text class="s" x={x0 - 8} y={y0 + 4} text-anchor="end">0V</text>
    <text class="s" x={x0 - 8} y={py(63.2) + 4} text-anchor="end">63%</text>
    <text class="s" x={x0 - 8} y={py(100) + 4} text-anchor="end">9V</text>
    <text class="s" x={x0 - 8} y={py(86.5) - 2} text-anchor="end" style="font-size:11px">86%</text>
    {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5].map((t) => <text class="s c" x={px(t)} y={y0 + 20}>{t}τ</text>)}
    {[1, 2, 3, 5].map((t) => <text class="s c" x={px(t)} y={y0 + 38} style="font-size:12px; fill:var(--ink3)">{t * 10}초</text>)}
    <text class="s c" x={px(2.5)} y={y0 + 62}>충전한 시간 (예: 10kΩ, 1000µF → τ = 10초)</text>

    <text class="b" x="30" y="30">전압</text>
    <text class="b" x="400" y="150">1τ (10초): 약 5.7V</text>
    <text class="b" x="400" y="176">2τ (20초): 약 7.8V</text>
    <text class="b" x="400" y="202">3τ (30초): 약 8.6V</text>
    <text class="s" x="400" y="232">5τ (50초): 거의 다 참(9V)</text>
    <text class="s" x="400" y="256">τ = R × C</text>
    <text class="s" x="400" y="274">(10,000Ω × 0.001F = 10초)</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption>그림 2. 충전 곡선(9V 전원). 시간상수 τ(타우) = 저항 × 용량이며, τ가 클수록 천천히 충전됩니다.</figcaption>
</figure>
